                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e583c75-ce7e-3cbc-88c1-c7c5da01fe2c",
                        "entry_id": "0999a9a1-74d8-3883-bcea-5ec53e598016",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To direct (an artistic work) with another person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23391c60-57f1-4dae-bfdd-469a3d6872a9",
                                "sense_id": "2e583c75-ce7e-3cbc-88c1-c7c5da01fe2c",
                                "text": "Jones insists he had no warning but does remember Bussert saying at some point, \"I think you want to codirect this show.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33d02b47-4404-49e9-93fc-e180be085927",
                                "sense_id": "2e583c75-ce7e-3cbc-88c1-c7c5da01fe2c",
                                "text": "On the same visit to Oberlin he volunteered to codirect a school production of Tartuffe, in which he also played a bit part that turned out to be fateful."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
